            "review_title": "Review at Mo - Homemade Pasta & Dessert",
            "review_text": "Ke\n1 contribution\n0\nFirst visit to Mo\nAug 2022 • Solo\nThis really is a hidden gem! The fairy lights just makes it feel magical. \n\nFood is AWESOME. The menu here is minimal, but what they do , they do it pretty well. \n\nDoesn't seem to have garnered a following yet - but that means more space for solo travellers like myself, haha. \n\nReally greatful to the staff who made me feel at home.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 10, 2022",
