            "review_text": "Piotr M\nKo Kut, Thailand10 contributions\n0\nCame to the restaurant by accident\nJan 2020\nCame to the restaurant by accident. Decided to stay just to change the taste. 6weeks of eating rice is too much. The inside was nice, the vibe was good. Unfortunately the menu was limited. 3/5 positions were unavailable even tea. We waited more than 25 minutes for the order. They brought both dishes separately. My wife eat the diner just before me plate was served.\nWe took pasta with mushrooms and pasta with shrimps. I won’t tell you what were my experiences. Next day, me and my wife are sick. We suspect the sour cream they used to thicken the sauce was off the date. Big disappointment.\nRead more\nWritten January 29, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
