            "review_title": "Review at Mo - Homemade Pasta & Dessert",
            "review_text": "Minh Tuan P\nDa Nang, Vietnam183 contributions\n0\nOne of the best homemade pasta in town\nOct 2019\nI have been to this restaurant quite several times in order to try all this dishes. I must say that none of those dishes failed my expectation. \nThe restaurant is warm and cozy space with nice decor and friendly smile from the staff. The foods are really good. Homemade fresh pastas with some Western - Eastern fusion. I would suggest you should try the Mushroom cream pasta (excuse me if i get the name wrong). Creamy sauce mixed well with the freshness of 4 kinds of mushroom, Crunchy, a bit chewy, nutty, milky smooth but not so fatty are what i like about this dish. \nAlso, never forget to try some home made dessert.\n\nWill come again for more.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 15, 2019\nKarmKonos\nThanks for your recommend <3\nWritten November 18, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
